  "description": "Retrospective listed building consent for the installation of an external stainless-steel twin-wall flue terminal at main roof level, serving a DEFRA-approved wood-burning stove within the basement flat. The flue system is a TWPRO Twin Wall Chimney System (MI Flues), 175mm outer diameter, approximately 1,400mm in height, matt black finish. A small quantity of cement mortar was used to secure the flue base. The installation is wholly reversible and no structural works were carried out. The flue was installed and necessary following removal of the original chimney stack by the owners of the adjoining property at 6-8 Westbourne Terrace.",
